# PARTSET: the humanoid body as DATA (D30 step 1, 2026-11-05). Before this, the same shapes were written in C (human() in generator_voxel_op.c); the output is pinned byte-identical by the harness.
# PS | set | part | x | y | z | w | d | h | colour | when      (a solid box in the 24 grid; x right, y depth (0 = front), z up)
# PP | set | pose | part | dx | dy | dz                       (moves one named part for that pose)
# x y z w d h are integers or sums of integers and the variables  tx (left edge of the torso) and bw (torso width: 6, 8 or 10 by the cast body 0, 1, 2).
# colour is #rrggbb or one of $skin $hair $gar $trim (the cast row's skin, hair, garment, trim).
# when is optional, comma separated, all must hold:  mark=1   style=X   style!=X   (styles: short long mohawk masked clown none). Rows are emitted in file order: a later part draws over an earlier one.
PS | humanoid | legl  | tx+1    | 10 | 0  | 3  | 3 | 5 | #15161a
PS | humanoid | legr  | tx+bw-4 | 10 | 0  | 3  | 3 | 5 | #15161a
PS | humanoid | torso | tx      | 9  | 5  | bw | 5 | 6 | $gar
PS | humanoid | chain | 10      | 8  | 8  | 4  | 1 | 1 | $trim | mark=1
PS | humanoid | head  | 8       | 9  | 11 | 8  | 5 | 6 | $hair | style=masked
PS | humanoid | head  | 8       | 9  | 11 | 8  | 5 | 6 | #f4f0e8 | style=clown
PS | humanoid | head  | 8       | 9  | 11 | 8  | 5 | 6 | $skin | style!=masked,style!=clown
PS | humanoid | eyel  | 10      | 8  | 14 | 1  | 1 | 1 | $trim | style=masked
PS | humanoid | eyel  | 10      | 8  | 14 | 1  | 1 | 1 | #15161a | style!=masked
PS | humanoid | eyer  | 13      | 8  | 14 | 1  | 1 | 1 | $trim | style=masked
PS | humanoid | eyer  | 13      | 8  | 14 | 1  | 1 | 1 | #15161a | style!=masked
PS | humanoid | nose  | 12      | 8  | 13 | 1  | 1 | 1 | #d62828 | style=clown
PS | humanoid | wigl  | 7       | 9  | 12 | 1  | 5 | 5 | $hair | style=clown
PS | humanoid | wigr  | 16      | 9  | 12 | 1  | 5 | 5 | $hair | style=clown
PS | humanoid | wigt  | 8       | 9  | 17 | 8  | 5 | 2 | $hair | style=clown
PS | humanoid | hairt | 8       | 9  | 17 | 8  | 5 | 1 | $hair | style=short
