PS | humanoid | hairt | 8       | 9  | 17 | 8  | 5 | 1 | $hair | style=long
PS | humanoid | hairb | 7       | 13 | 6  | 10 | 2 | 11 | $hair | style=long
PS | humanoid | hairl | 7       | 9  | 12 | 1  | 4 | 5 | $hair | style=long
PS | humanoid | hairr | 16      | 9  | 12 | 1  | 4 | 5 | $hair | style=long
PS | humanoid | hairt | 11      | 9  | 17 | 2  | 5 | 3 | $hair | style=mohawk
